EMD reference implementation attribution
======================================

The behavior adaptations in envelope/envelope.cpp and emd/decomposition.cpp
are based on the locally supplied emd 0.8.1 Python package, specifically
emd/_sift_core.py and emd/sift.py, by Andrew Quinn and the emd contributors.

Upstream source: https://gitlab.com/emd-dev/emd
Upstream documentation: https://emd.readthedocs.io/

Reference package: emd 0.8.1, module emd.sift.
Local source supplied by the user: D:/Python/Lib/site-packages/emd.

The distribution metadata identifies GPLv2 or later; its supplied LICENSE.txt
contains the GNU General Public License version 3. That original license text
is retained verbatim in LICENSE.emd. These adaptations are not PyEMD /
EMD-signal code and do not use that project's Apache license attribution.
